     3	description: Upload verification screenshots to the Roam dev graph and get public image URLs plus a Markdown table for the PR body. Use after a verification run produced PNGs and before create-pr writes the Evidence section.
     4	---
     5	
     6	# PR evidence upload
     7	
     8	Uploads PNGs through `roamAlphaAPI.file.upload` in an authenticated Roam Playwright slot, files them under a page in the slot's graph (`discourse-dev-graph`), and emits a Markdown table that create-pr pastes into the Evidence section.
     9	
    10	## When to use
    11	
    12	- After verification (Roam `load-extension` run, Obsidian CDP run, manual captures) left PNGs on disk.
    13	- Before create-pr builds the body. Roam PRs: reuse the verification's slot once that run has closed. Obsidian PRs: omit `--slot`.
    14	
    15	## Command
    16	
    17	Run from the worktree root, using the worktree's own `tsx` so the relative PNG paths and the repo's Playwright resolve:
    18	
    19	```sh
    20	./apps/roam/node_modules/.bin/tsx ~/.claude/skills/pr-evidence/upload.ts \
    21	  [--slot N] [--branch <b>] [--label "<YYYY-MM-DD · shortsha · harness>"] [--harness <name>] \
    22	  [--out table.md] [--settle-ms 5000] \
    23	  shot1.png="Empty state" shot2.png="After import" ...
    24	```
    25	
    26	- `pnpm --filter roam exec tsx ...` also works, but it changes cwd to `apps/roam`, so pass absolute PNG paths.
    27	- `--branch` defaults to the current git branch. `--label` defaults to `<today> · <short sha> · <--harness or "manual">`.
    28	- Caption defaults to the file name without extension.
    29	- No `--slot`: tries each configured slot (1, 2, 3) and moves on only on a profile-lock error.
    30	- Headless by default (`HEADLESS=false` to watch).
    31	
    32	## Output contract
    33	
    34	- stdout: JSON `{page, pageUid, branchBlockUid, runBlockUid, items: [{caption, url, blockUid}]}`.
    35	- stderr: `Markdown table: <path>`. The file defaults to `pr-evidence-<runBlockUid>.md` next to the first PNG and contains `| Scenario | Screenshot |` rows with `![caption](url)`. create-pr pastes it as-is.
    36	- URLs are public Firebase storage links (`200 image/png` without cookies, verified 2026-09-23).
    37	
    38	## Roam structure
    39	
    40	```
    41	Trang test/                       (page, found or created)
    42	  <branch>                        (top-level block, reused on every run)
    43	    <date · sha · harness>        (new run block per invocation, appended last)
    44	      <caption> ![](<url>)        (one per PNG)
    45	```
    46	
    47	## Gotchas
    48	
    49	- Imports `apps/roam/scripts/playwright/roamSession.ts` from the current worktree (`git rev-parse --show-toplevel`), so profiles live in that worktree's `local/roam-playwright/profiles/` unless `DG_ROAM_PLAYWRIGHT_PROFILE_DIR_<n>` is set.
    50	- A slot's profile can only be open once. Close the verification session first, never delete lock files.
    51	- Login errors (expired session, 2FA) come from `openRoamSession`; recover with `pnpm --filter roam playwright:open -- --slot N --headed --allow-login`, then rerun.
    52	- Never print values from `apps/roam/.env`.
    53	- Uploads cannot be rolled back and Roam cannot list graph files, so don't loop retries on a failing run.
    54	- tsx injects `__name()` into functions passed to `page.evaluate`; the script shims it in the page first. Keep that shim if you edit the in-page code.
